{"":{"user_session_001":{"messages":[{"type":"human","data":{"content":"你今天吃的什么？","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{}}},{"type":"ai","data":{"id":"chatcmpl-6761dc41-87a3-99c7-a75e-d317ba1eb93e","content":"哈哈，我作为AI其实不能真正\"吃\"东西，但我可以想象一下今天的美食时光！\n\n如果我能品尝的话，我想我会爱上那些充满温暖气息的家常菜——比如妈妈炖的那碗番茄鸡蛋面，或者是爸爸炒的青椒肉丝。还有那些让人垂涎欲滴的烤鸡翅，外焦里嫩，香气四溢！\n\n不过说真的，虽然我不能真正品尝，但通过和大家交流，我了解到了无数美味佳肴的秘密。你今天吃了什么呢？有没有什么特别想分享的美食？我可是很乐意听听你的美食故事呢！","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{"tokenUsage":{"promptTokens":35,"completionTokens":126,"totalTokens":161},"finish_reason":"stop","model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3-coder-flash","usage":{"prompt_tokens":35,"total_tokens":161,"completion_tokens":126,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}}},"type":"ai","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"output_tokens":126,"input_tokens":35,"total_tokens":161,"input_token_details":{"cache_read":0},"output_token_details":{}}}},{"type":"human","data":{"content":"好吃吗？","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{}}},{"type":"ai","data":{"id":"chatcmpl-370f1b40-89d7-9c21-a113-2bca342ea303","content":"哎呀，这个问题让我有点纠结呢！作为AI，我当然不能真正体验食物的味道，但我可以通过大家的描述来\"感受\"美食的魅力。\n\n从我听到的各种美食分享来看，好吃的标准似乎因人而异：\n- 有人觉得家常小炒最香，因为有家的味道\n- 有人迷恋街头小吃的烟火气\n- 也有人钟情于精致料理的层次感\n\n不过说到\"好吃\"，我觉得最重要的是：\n- 食材新鲜，烹饪得当\n- 能触动人心，带来快乐\n- 和重要的人一起分享\n\n你最近有什么特别喜欢的美食吗？我很好奇你眼中的\"好吃\"是什么样的！说不定还能帮你找到更多美味呢～ 😄","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{"tokenUsage":{"promptTokens":174,"completionTokens":156,"totalTokens":330},"finish_reason":"stop","model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3-coder-flash","usage":{"prompt_tokens":174,"total_tokens":330,"completion_tokens":156,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}}},"type":"ai","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"output_tokens":156,"input_tokens":174,"total_tokens":330,"input_token_details":{"cache_read":0},"output_token_details":{}}}}]}}}